1
00:00:00,589 --> 00:00:02,629
-Hey, here's your tip from Table 7.
-Oh, thanks.

2
00:00:02,799 --> 00:00:05,759
(Penny:)-Mm-hm.
-Testing. Check. Check two.

3
00:00:07,262 --> 00:00:08,342
(Bernadette:)Oh, now what?

4
00:00:08,513 --> 00:00:11,513
(Penny:)-You want me to throw him out?
-No, that's okay.

5
00:00:11,683 --> 00:00:13,933
(Penny:)Are you sure? He's small.

6
00:00:14,102 --> 00:00:17,312
Bet I could get a nice tight spiral
on him.

7
00:00:18,106 --> 00:00:23,526
I wanna dedicate this number
to a great gal who I've done wrong.

8
00:00:25,989 --> 00:00:27,529
[SINGING]
Bernadette

9
00:00:28,241 --> 00:00:33,371
(Howard:)I am so sorry
For trying to propose to you

10
00:00:34,289 --> 00:00:35,539
(Penny:)Bernadette

11
00:00:36,458 --> 00:00:42,218
(Howard:)You found it creepy
But that's just the kind of thing I do

12
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:44,220
Ahhh

13
00:00:44,382 --> 00:00:48,382
(Howard:)I know now it was too soon
To talk of love

14
00:00:48,553 --> 00:00:52,393
(Howard:)It was just a crazy idea
That came to me in my tub

15
00:00:52,557 --> 00:00:55,227
(Howard:)But, Bernadette
Give me one more chance

16
00:00:55,393 --> 00:00:56,683
(Howard:)Sweet Bernadette

17
00:00:56,853 --> 00:00:59,313
(Howard:)I'll get the hang of this thing
They call romance

18
00:00:59,481 --> 00:01:00,981
(Howard:)Sweet Bernadette

19
00:01:01,149 --> 00:01:03,689
(Howard:)I dream to once again
Kiss your lips

20
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,070
(Howard:)Sweet Bernadette

21
00:01:05,237 --> 00:01:09,197
(Howard:)Sincerely yours, Howard Wolowitz

22
00:01:09,366 --> 00:01:10,406
(Penny:)Bernadette

23
00:01:10,575 --> 00:01:13,575
(Penny:)Oh, I am so sorry.

24
00:01:13,745 --> 00:01:14,785
(Bernadette:)Are you kidding?

25
00:01:14,955 --> 00:01:17,835
(Bernadette:)That's the most romantic thing
anyone's ever done for me.

26
00:01:18,917 --> 00:01:19,997
(Penny:)Bernadette

27
00:01:20,168 --> 00:01:21,708
(Howard(still singing):)Thank you, Cheesecake Factory.

28
00:01:21,878 --> 00:01:23,668
[CROWD CHEERS]

